<title>UK: Legal&amp;General premiums up in first 4 months.</title>
<headline>Legal&amp;General premiums up in first 4 months.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>British insurance group Legal &amp; General Group Plc said on Wednesday that annual premiums were up over 25 percent in the first four months of the year and that single premiums were more than 80 percent higher.</p>
</text>
